# Cursor Standard Rules (Project-Adapted)

## Code Generation Discipline

- Prefer clarity over cleverness
- Avoid speculative abstractions
- Do not introduce libraries unless required

## File & Folder Hygiene

- Follow App Router conventions strictly
- No mixed concerns in single file
- Components must reflect PRD naming

## Change Policy

When modifying code:
1. Identify which PRD section it belongs to
2. Confirm Phase 1 or Phase 2
3. If unclear → do NOT implement

Cursor should ask for clarification instead of guessing
when PRD alignment is uncertain.
